   "id": "54164c93",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#| echo: false\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "from scipy.integrate import solve_ivp"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7c3e0e13",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Zadanie 1\n",
    "\n",
    "Dane jest równanie\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\\dot{x} = kx(1 - x)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "## Wyznaczanie punktów stałych i ich stabilności\n",
    "\n",
    "Oznaczając za $f(x)=kx(1-x)$, punkty stałe wyznaczamy z $f(x^*_i)=0$. Rozwiązaniem są $x_1=0$ oraz\n",
    "$x_2=1$.\n",
    "\n",
    "Wyznaczenie stabilności punktów opiera się na analizie pochodnej funkcji $f(x)$\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\n",
    "f'(x) = k(1 - 2x)\n",
    "$$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Punkt $x_1 = 0$\n",
    "\n",
    "Dla $x_1=0$ otrzymujemy $f'(x_1) = k$\n",
    "\n",
    "### Punkt $x_2 = 1$\n",
    "\n",
    "Dla $x_2=1$ otrzymujemy $f'(x_2) = -k$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a8b6020f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Numeryczne wyznaczenie rozwiązania $x(t)$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "id": "7d2a8c5b",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1280x960 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    },
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1280x960 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def f1(t, x, k):\n",
    "    return k * x * (1 - x)\n",
    "\n",
    "t_span = [0, 3]\n",
    "t_eval = np.linspace(0, 3, 100)\n",
    "\n",
    "x0_arr = np.arange(-1.0, 2.2, 0.2)\n",
    "\n",
    "k_arr = [-1, 1]\n",
    "\n",
    "for k in k_arr:\n",
    "    fig, ax = plt.subplots(dpi=200)\n",
    "\n",
    "    for x0 in x0_arr:\n",
    "        sol = solve_ivp(f1, t_span, [x0], args=(k,), t_eval=t_eval, method=\"RK45\")\n",
    "        ax.plot(sol.t, sol.y[0], label=f\"$x_0 =$ {x0:.1f}\", lw=1.0,)\n",
    "        ax.set_title(f\"Wyniki dla $k = $ {k}\")\n",
    "        ax.set_ylim(2*k, k * -10)\n",
    "\n",
    "    plt.legend(fontsize=5)\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "9c110c94",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": []
  }
